 id="experience" class="py-20 px-8"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-yellow-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-4">Experience</h2><p class="text-lg text-blue-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto">A journey through my professional experiences and personal projects</p></div><div class="space-y-8"><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Natixis Algérie</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">Dec 2024 - May 2025</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-orange-900/50 text-orange-300 border border-orange-700">Internship</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Two-stage internship program: Discovery phase exploring banking departments, followed by feasibility study for a Natural Language Processing system in banking documentation.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>1st Stage: Discovery - Explored various banking departments related to data, IT systems, and security</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>2nd Stage: Feasibility study for NLP system in banking documentation retrieval</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">AI/ML</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Python</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">NLP</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Banking</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Document Processing</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Data Analysis</span></div></div><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Application Scolaire - A ALIMNI</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">2024</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-900/50 text-green-300 border border-green-700">Project</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Cross-platform Flutter mobile application for complete school management system with multi-role authentication and real-time communication features.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Multi-role authentication (Super Admin, Admin, Professor, Parent)</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Academic tracking (grades, absences, exams)</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Real-time communication (notifications, announcements, documents)</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Complete administrative panel</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Flutter</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Firebase</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Mobile Development</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Authentication</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Real-time Communication</span></div></div><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Application E-commerce - KLS</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">2024</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-900/50 text-green-300 border border-green-700">Project</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Full-stack e-commerce web platform for custom PC sales with interactive PC builder, multilingual support, and comprehensive admin panel.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Interactive PC builder with compatibility checking and power calculation</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Complete product catalog and order management</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Multi-language and multi-currency support</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Responsive mobile-first design</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Admin panel for inventory and user management</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex f