class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Project Management</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Mentoring</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Web Development</span></div></div><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Industrial Engineers Club</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">2024 - Present</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-300 border border-purple-700">Leadership</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">IT responsible for Business Game 4.0 event, managing technical aspects and ensuring smooth execution of the competition.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>IT responsible for Business Game 4.0 event</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Technical management and coordination</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Active member of IT team</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Event Management</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Technical Coordination</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Leadership</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">IT Management</span></div></div><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Baseera - Startup Project</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">2024</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-900/50 text-green-300 border border-green-700">Project</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">A Flutter app connecting psychologists to patients with real-time booking features and messaging. Built with Firebase backend and real-time chat functionality.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Real-time booking system for psychological consultations</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Messaging system between psychologists and patients</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Firebase backend integration</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>User authentication and profile management</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Flutter</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Firebase</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Real-time Chat</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Mobile Development</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Healthcare Tech</span></div></div><div class=" border-2 border-blue-600 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-orange-400 hover:shadow-orange-500/10 transition-all duration-200"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between mb-4"><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white-900 mb-2">Feeling Box</h3></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mt-2 md:mt-0"><span class="text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium">2023</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-900/50 text-green-300 border border-green-700">Project</span></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">A React web app that allows users to select their current feeling and provides a Quran verse corresponding to that feeling, using Firebase database.</p><div class="mb-4"><h4 class="text-white text-sm font-medium mb-2">Key Responsibilities &amp; Features:</h4><ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1"><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Emotion-based Quran verse recommendation system</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>User-friendly interface for emotion selection</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Firebase database integration</span></li><li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-blue-500 mr-2 mt-1">•</span><span>Responsive web design</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">React</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Firebase</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Web Development</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">UI/UX</span><span class="bg-blue-600 text-blue-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">Spiritual Tech</span></div></div></div></div></section><sec